// is a CUMULATIVE utime+stime counter, so a bare `>` test reads any
// trickle · a wedged node process polling a dead socket · as "alive" and
// pins liveness_age_s at 0 forever, disabling the dead kill entirely (the
// same Inkling trials: progress_age_s reached 10,750s against a 2,400s dead
// window with liveness_age_s 0 at all 179 probes). A real working agent
// burns far more than this; the observed delta ships in each probe so the
// floor can be retuned from data.
// The env knob is jiffies per 60s of wall clock (~= percent CPU at
// USER_HZ=100) and is scaled to the actual probe cadence, so retuning
// PROBE_SEC does not silently retune the floor · unscaled, a shorter
// cadence would make the floor stricter, and on a blind run the dead kill
